1. **`security-reviewer` agent** (tiers 2, 3) — a fresh-context pass on the diff. Verify each finding; it feeds the passes below and never replaces them. Scope of every pass: a kit file still identical to its hash in `.claude/harness.json` was reviewed in the kit — read the seeds, the project's own files and the files HD-1 lists, also in a pull request that installs or updates the kit. → `docs/conventions/security-review.md`
1. **`/project-security-review`** (tier 3) — this project's catalogue and invariants, and the scanner to run for the area touched.
